WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.600 line:10%
Èske ou janm mande kijan yon misk vrèman vin pi kout?

2
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.439 line:10%
Nan repo, myozin nan deja sèvi ak ATP pou l rive nan yon eta

3
00:00:06.439 --> 00:00:09.203 line:10%
pare ak gwo enèji, men tropomyozin nan toujou

4
00:00:09.203 --> 00:00:10.398 line:10%
bloke chemen l.

5
00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:12.792 line:10%
Lè n zoume, ATP a divize an ADP ak

6
00:00:12.792 --> 00:00:15.321 line:10%
fosfat, sa ki mete tèt myozin nan nan pozisyon

7
00:00:15.321 --> 00:00:17.199 line:10%
pare ak gwo enèji li.

8
00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:19.795 line:10%
Kalsyòm anvayi epi tache ak troponin,

9
00:00:19.795 --> 00:00:21.999 line:10%
sa ki pouse tropomyozin nan sou kote.

10
00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:25.414 line:10%
Kounye a myozin nan kenbe aktin epi fè kou fòs la,

11
00:00:25.414 --> 00:00:27.911 line:10%
li lage fosfat la menm lè l ap rale,

12
00:00:27.911 --> 00:00:29.878 line:10%
li rale filaman an anndan.

13
00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:32.920 line:10%
Yon nouvo ATP tache epi myozin nan lage aktin,

14
00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:35.000 line:10%
l ap prepare pou pwochen kou a.

15
00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:37.902 line:10%
Sik apre sik, filaman yo glise pi fon anndan,

16
00:00:37.902 --> 00:00:39.559 line:10%
epi tout misk la vin pi kout.

17
00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:47.149 line:10%
Men tout sik la nan yon sèl kou je,

18
00:00:47.149 --> 00:00:50.919 line:10%
nikleyotid ki tache a ak pozisyon tèt la nan chak etap.

19
00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:52.593 line:10%
Twa etap: ATP prepare

20
00:00:52.593 --> 00:00:54.822 line:10%
tèt la, kalsyòm ouvri sit la,

21
00:00:54.822 --> 00:00:58.405 line:10%
epi kou fòs la rale aktin, epi repete sa

22
00:00:58.405 --> 00:00:59.838 line:10%
fè misk la vin pi kout.

